Dear LaTeX3 activists,

I am finishing a reference manual for the XY-pic GRAPHIC PRIMITIVES
(these are independent of the diagram features).  I was wondering
whether this specification is of interest to any LaTeX3 designers with
respect to the LaTeX3 PICTURE ENVIRONMENT?

They are implemented using 5 auxiliary fonts and there is a PostScript
`backend' replacing the use of the special fonts with DVIPS or
TeXtures PS specials.

